        "id": 1978840
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-15T16:35:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I only found this being set to false as an experiment baseline in google3. I think it makes sense to promote this to enabled by default, and dropping the config option (both here and in Chromium).",
