      "writtenOn": "2023-02-15T16:35:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t like using the name \"async\" as it\u0027s an implementation detail of the Chromium stack, that\u0027s also why I changed the name from async to something else in Chromium. It becomes a little difficult to explain now that both the \"Cronet DNS stacnk\" and \"AOSP stack\" are part of AOSP and still be brief. The best I could come up with is that it\u0027s the DNS specific to the HTTP stack, but I\u0027m definitely open to suggestions.",
